# Octofit Tracker Frontend Environment Configuration
# 
# Copy this file to .env.local and set your Codespaces name.
# For Codespaces: Your codespace name appears in the terminal prompt or GitHub UI.
# This value must be defined for Codespaces API URL generation.

# Codespaces environment variable (set this for Codespaces deployment)
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=your-codespace-name

# Example for Codespaces:
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=reimagined-halibut-7pj7vwg6j94hp695
# This will build API URLs like:
# https://reimagined-halibut-7pj7vwg6j94hp695-8000.app.github.dev/api/users

# For local development, leave VITE_CODESPACE_NAME unset and the frontend falls back
# to a local /api path (for Vite proxying or local API routing).
# Optionally set VITE_API_BASE_URL to an explicit backend URL.
#
# Example local override:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8001
